// Package brand is the design tokens the companion's native code draws with: the colours of the
// Windows title bar and the ground behind the webview. tokens_gen.go is generated by
// design/tokens/build.mjs from design/tokens/tokens.json (the same palette the API's
// internal/brand carries); never edit it, edit tokens.json and run `node design/tokens/build.mjs`.
// The window itself reads the same tokens through ui/tokens.css.
package brand
